Flutter branch changes, September-October 2026:
New Flutter presentation, reader, local library/cache, Android bridges and
listening implementation. Modified on 2026-10-15 to retire vendor-specific
speech integration, add configurable low-performance rendering, remove runtime
diagnostic entries and keep chapter-level listening progress/media metadata.

The original Android app's embedded JNI API runtime (libcpp.so) is required
only for legacy network API requests and is omitted from the public git
checkout by default. An inherited note states that the upstream maintainer
confirmed on 2026-10-15 that unchanged redistribution is permitted; its source
is not present here, and it is a separately authorized third-party binary not
covered by this project's source license. Do not modify it or infer additional
rights from the GPL notice for the application.

